/T (The convenience of the digital world lets us manage our lives online, but it has also made it easier for cardholders to dispute a transaction with a single click. Global chargeback volumes are projected to reach 324 million by 2028, a double-digit increase over the 261 million forecast for 2025. Correspondingly, global card fraud losses are projected to reach $41.06 billion by 2030.)
