/Title (The defining asymmetry of the coming decade is machine-speed payments met by human-speed exception handling. The only back-office operation capable of keeping pace with autonomous commerce is an autonomous dispute management platform. Industry front-runners are abandoning manual intake and adopting agentic dispute management. By deploying intelligent automation, banks can separate genuine fraud from first-party misuse, process structured machine evidence, and resolve claims  with zero-touch efficiency.)
