/Title (However, the back-office operations that handle exceptions remain reliant on human-speed processes, caseworkers manually interpreting claims, gathering evidence and navigating legacy systems. This linear, manual model costs up to $10.32 per dispute. When high-frequency, machine-initiated micro-transactions meet manual exception handling, the unit economics of issuer operations will collapse.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1333 0 R
/Prev 1543 0 R
/Next 1463 0 R
