/Title (of merchants plan to increase spending on fraud tools and technology \(2025 Global eCommerce Payments & Fraud Report, Visa Acceptance Solutions, Verifi & Merchant Risk Council\), shifting toward digital screening and automated rule updates for compelling evidence. Merchants now fight back against first-party misuse at scale.)
